<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Founding Pilot Terms — Baltic Crew Exchange</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/styles.css"></head><body><header class="site-header"><div class="container nav"><a class="brand" href="index.php"><span class="mark">BC</span><span>Baltic Crew<small>EXCHANGE</small></span></a><a class="btn secondary" href="index.php">Back to marketplace</a></div></header><main class="legal-page"><div class="container legal-copy"><p class="kicker">Founding pilot</p><h1>Pilot Participation Terms</h1><p>Last updated: 4 October 2026</p><h2>Service scope</h2><p>Baltic Crew Exchange provides a managed information and introduction service for legal entities. It is not an employer, employment agency, payroll provider or party to contracts concluded between participating companies.</p><h2>Listings</h2><p>All submissions are reviewed. We may request clarification or supporting documents and may edit, decline, pause or remove a listing. Publication does not constitute verification, certification or a guarantee of availability, suitability or performance.</p><h2>Company responsibility</h2><p>Each company remains responsible for its employees, permits, insurance, tax, immigration, labour, health and safety and contractual obligations. Each party must perform its own commercial, legal and technical due diligence.</p><h2>Introductions</h2><p>Contact information is not public. It may be disclosed after relevant interest is reviewed and both sides approve an introduction. Participation or an introduction does not require either company to enter into a contract.</p><h2>Founding Pilot Offer</h2><p>The first 10 approved crew providers may receive profile creation, publication and introductions without subscription or commission during the initial 90-day pilot. Eligibility is confirmed individually. Any future pricing will be communicated in advance and will not apply retroactively.</p><h2>Accuracy and acceptable use</h2><p>Submitting companies must provide accurate information and have authority to represent the stated legal entity. Misleading, unlawful or individual-worker recruitment submissions may be removed.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions and requests may be sent to <a href="mailto:info@balticcrewexchange.eu">info@balticcrewexchange.eu</a>.</p></div></main></body></html>
